# Keep secrets, local state and generated files out of the image build context.
.git
.github
node_modules
build
data
web/dist
docs/internal
**/.prepublish-deny
**/*.key
**/*.pem
**/*.p12
**/*.pfx
**/*.wif
# Recovery phrases, seed backups and editor swap or backup copies (of a key, say), as .gitignore.
**/mnemonic*
**/seed*.txt
**/*.swp
**/*.swo
**/*~
**/wallets
**/relay-balance
**/relayer.json
**/state.json
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/.fixtures-tmp*
**/*-tmp.*
**/*.log
**/*.tmp
**/*.part
# Deployment settings and backups: real env files (the *.example files stay), the compose env
# file, encrypted backups and backup keys (keygen writes <name>.key, caught by **/*.key, and <name>.key.pub).
deploy/**/*.env
deploy/docker/compose.env
**/*.mbk
**/*.key.pub
.vite
.vscode
.idea
.claude
**/.DS_Store
**/Thumbs.db
**/desktop.ini
LICENSE-CHOICE.md
PUBLISHING.md
